From: "Barak A. Pearlmutter" <barak+git@pearlmutter.net>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:19:02 +0100
Subject: shell completion for bash and zsh

For disparPDF and disparPDFc: the options, the values of --language,
--debug and --outType, file names for --pdfdiff, --xmlResult and
--settings, and PDF files to compare (any files after --any-extension).
--batch is not offered for disparPDFc, which is always in batch mode.

Installed in share/bash-completion/completions and
share/zsh/site-functions, or as set by BASH_COMPLETION_DIR and
ZSH_COMPLETION_DIR.

Tests check that every option either program's --help lists is in both
completions, and run the completions in bash and in an interactive zsh;
those two are skipped without bash-completion or zsh.

